      "message": "Size seen by the compiler. e.g. https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/chromium-browser-clang/chrome_includes_2025-04-29_050817.html\n\nAlso note how the pre-C++20 spans have smaller expanded sizes. https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/chromium-browser-clang/chrome_includes_2025-04-29_050817.html#view\u003dfiles\u0026filter\u003d%5C%2Fspan%5C.h\u0026sort\u003dasize\u0026reverse\u003d\u0026includer\u003d\u0026included\u003d\u0026limit\u003d1000\n\nThis CL is just rewriting the parts that got the most increase, which also happens to be the part that doesn\u0027t actually need spans.",
